{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"77933","name":"Palais Tinmel","description":"This hotel is located in the North of the medina of Marrakech, close to Jemâa El Fna square, in the ancient district of the Caîd El Ayadi. Guests can enjoy the principal places of interest in Marrakech such as Souks, Majorelle gardens and Kutubia Mosque. The hotel has been restored to its initial state (Spanish-Moresque style), using the local and traditional materials of Morocco. The hotel has been classified as one of the top riads by the tourism authorities of Marrakesh. Guests are guaranteed comfortable accommodation and personalised service. This historical guest house has 6 rooms in total, and offers guests facilities including a 24-hour reception, a TV room, a breakfast room and a laundry service. The rooms all come equipped with a bathroom with a shower, plus individually regulated air conditioning and heating units. The hotel is located near a road of golf courses, on the way to the Palmgrove. Guests can also enjoy the enchanting golf courses in Marrakech. The hotel itself offers an outdoor swimming pool, a solarium, massage treatments and a tennis court. The hotel provides a bed and breakfast service and an à la carte evening meal.","address":"1-4 Derb Khettara-Kaa El Mechraa","city":"MARRAKECH","countryCode":"MA","postalCode":"40000","lat":31.641897,"lng":-7.991321,"stars":4,"giataCode":"90973","phone":"00212561082042","email":"CONTACT@RIAD-TINMEL-MARRAKECH.COM","website":"www.riad-tinmel-marrakech.com","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/07/077933/077933a_hb_a_001.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/07/077933/077933a_hb_a_002.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/07/077933/077933a_hb_a_005.jpg","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/07/077933/077933a_hb_a_012.jpg","category":"exterior","order":3},{"ur